# Code owners for the MCP parity gate.
#
# The parity test decides which web endpoints may stay out of the MCP. Its
# exclusion list and the CI guard are security-adjacent: weakening either
# lets an API-key-callable endpoint skip the MCP. Changes need a code owner
# review, and the guard also requires the `parity-exclusion-approved` label
# to be applied by a code owner (see
# .github/workflows/parity-exclusion-guard.yml).

